# Words left in a chat's field and the app left there: what 07-draft-restart (sfreplay) starts the app again over, the
# draft the core kept (composer.text) back in the field. Run just before it (its `// before it:`), so it leans on no
# other run. The chat left and opened again before the run ends: leaving it is what has the core write the draft
# down at once (client.focus `left`), not a moment after its last change, when the app may be gone.
#env MBUI_PLATFORM=android
timeout 60000
tap 端到端测试
until =studio
tap 发消息
type 还没发出去的草稿 {T}
answered composer.text
tap icon:chevron-left
until 端到端测试
tap 端到端测试
until =studio
